<title>USA: Traverse City APS, Mich., won by EVEREN Sec.</title>
<headline>Traverse City APS, Mich., won by EVEREN Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Sec. said it won $15 million of Traverse City Area PS, Mich., 1997 general obligation school building and site bonds, Series II, with a net interest cost of 5.58 percent.</p>
</text>
